<title>GERMANY: Vereinsbank sees room for shares to rise.</title>
<headline>Vereinsbank sees room for shares to rise.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Bayerische Vereinsbank AG said on Thursday it saw further room for its share price to rise.</p>
<p>Chairman Albrecht Schmidt told reporters he was happy with the strong rise in the bank's share price in recent months, which was mainly fuelled by merger speculation in the banking sector.</p>
<p>&quot;We have thus come significantly closer to the bank's basic value, but have not yet reached it. Thus there is leeway for a rise,&quot; Schmidt said.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
